t command.","/zh/research/Kurt-Hanel/mp-fps-game/","repository-research:comster/fps-threejs","comster/fps-threejs","Small browser FPS with enemies, health, score and reloading, accompanied by a beginner guide for extending the project using Claude Code or Codex.","/zh/research/comster/fps-threejs/","repository-research:iaanzhao/vertex-fps","iaanzhao/vertex-fps","Low-poly Three.js arena FPS with team deathmatch versus bots, destructible cover, three weapons and a separately hosted WebSocket multiplayer server.","/zh/research/iaanzhao/vertex-fps/","repository-research:8tp/instagib-arena","8tp/instagib-arena","Quake-style browser railgun FPS with documented authoritative multiplayer, lag compensation, offline bots, ranked duels, replays and configurable accessibility features.","/zh/research/8tp/instagib-arena/","repository-research:StarKnightt/cinder-ops","StarKnightt/cinder-ops","Procedural Three.js single-player extraction FPS with a street arena, four weapons, hostile AI, supply chests and synthesized audio.","/zh/research/StarKnightt/cinder-ops/","repository-research:whitwhoa/open-browser-fps","whitwhoa/open-browser-fps","Historical Three.js/Node.js/Socket.io authoritative-server movement example with multiplayer character synchronization, but no shooting implementation.","/zh/research/whitwhoa/open-browser-fps/","repository-research:vincenzo-afk/NIGHTFALL","vincenzo-afk/NIGHTFALL","TypeScript browser-FPS scaffold documenting hero classes, game modes, movement physics and validated network schemas; core combat and rendering remain unchecked.","/zh/research/vincenzo-afk/NIGHTFALL/","repository-research:StarKnightt/operation-ironhold","StarKnightt/operation-ironhold","Single-HTML browser FPS with a timed hostile-clearance objective, procedural world, weapons and audio, plus a published five-prompt AI build account.","/zh/research/StarKnightt/operation-ironhold/","repository-research:kamalesh404/velocity.io","kamalesh404/velocity.io","Three.js multiplayer FPS using R