h rendering backends still listed as development tasks.","/zh/research/eliassjogreen/pioneer/","repository-research:snowfrogdev/nanojet","snowfrogdev/nanojet","A TypeScript/Vite workspace containing a WebGPU engine and a Pong example. Inspected source connects an ECS world, game loop and renderer, with player/CPU paddles, scoring and synthesized scoring sound in the example.","/zh/research/snowfrogdev/nanojet/","repository-research:Refsa/pollus","Refsa/pollus","Small ECS-based C# engine with modular input/audio/UI systems and native/browser targets.","/zh/research/Refsa/pollus/","repository-research:kpreid/all-is-cubes","kpreid/all-is-cubes","Experimental editable voxel-world engine in which blocks are themselves built from smaller blocks, with CPU/GPU rendering and desktop/browser applications.","/zh/research/kpreid/all-is-cubes/","repository-research:load1n9/caviar","load1n9/caviar","Native/browser game engine with scene/world primitives, sprites, a procedural-noise example, a CLI, and documented Deno/browser entry points.","/zh/research/load1n9/caviar/","repository-research:michaelkolesidis/zigzag","michaelkolesidis/zigzag","Minimalist 3D endless-runner ball game in which each tap changes direction to stay on a narrow suspended path.","/zh/research/michaelkolesidis/zigzag/","repository-research:leslieyip02/racing","leslieyip02/racing","Small driving/racing demo with keyboard controls, thrust adjustment, and documented checkpoint shortcuts and time-step behavior.","/zh/research/leslieyip02/racing/","repository-research:GyuoMi/exidem","GyuoMi/exidem","Stairwell Iliad is a Three.js exploration/puzzle game whose inspected source wires a player, collision octree and item interactions; its ending code includes speech-recognition behavior and an alternate path when the speech helper is unavailable.","/zh/research/GyuoMi/exidem/","repository-research:Hack23/blacktrigram","Hack23/blacktrigram","Korean-martial-arts browser combat simulator with stance-based fighting, chara