nlucatruda/music-melee","gianlucatruda/music-melee","A parkour FPS built around musical timing and scoring, using spatial synthesis, physics, and browser rendering.","/zh/research/gianlucatruda/music-melee/","repository-research:tensorspace-ai/evolution-arena","tensorspace-ai/evolution-arena","A client-side procedural survival game where mutations change creature form and mechanics across generations, with energy, warmth, predators, and touch controls.","/zh/research/tensorspace-ai/evolution-arena/","repository-research:mohsenheydari/three-fps","mohsenheydari/three-fps","An FPS example with an entity/component architecture, Ammo.js rigid-body controls, root-motion NPC animation, and pathfinding.","/zh/research/mohsenheydari/three-fps/","repository-research:bbs220/project_block_shooter","bbs220/project_block_shooter","A low-poly multiplayer FPS prototype with React Three Fiber, a Node authoritative server, Rapier physics, client prediction, and hitscan combat.","/zh/research/bbs220/project_block_shooter/","repository-research:iamrichmack111/richmack-the-forest","iamrichmack111/richmack-the-forest","A haunted driving-survival game with dynamic enemies, camp missions, world events, vehicle combat, instancing, and object pooling.","/zh/research/iamrichmack111/richmack-the-forest/","repository-research:RealAbdurRehman/decay","RealAbdurRehman/decay","A browser survival shooter with monster waves, pickups, movement-dependent gun accuracy, changing maps, and a minimap.","/zh/research/RealAbdurRehman/decay/","repository-research:serejaris/dust-arena","serejaris/dust-arena","The requested Dust Arena repository remains unavailable. The same owner’s earlier claude-fable monorepo preserves historical source and a dated pointer into the requested repository.","/zh/research/serejaris/dust-arena/","repository-research:BarthPaleologue/CosmosJourneyer","BarthPaleologue/CosmosJourneyer","A Babylon.js space-exploration game with procedural planetary worlds, seamless surface exploration, browser/Electron delivery, and documented unit/E2E tests.","/zh/research/BarthPaleologue/CosmosJourneyer/","repository-research:braedonsaunders/voidstrike","braedonsaunders/voidstrike","A browser RTS documenting worker-based ECS simulation, fixed-step deterministic logic, lockstep WebRTC play, desync diagnostics, and GPU rendering.","/zh/research/braedonsaunders/voidstrike/","repository-research:Braffolk/fable5-world-demo","Braffolk/fable5-world-demo","A seeded procedural open-world renderer with generated terrain, erosion, vegetation, water, atmosphere, and documented screenshot/profiling checks.","/zh/research/Braffolk/fable5-world-demo/","repository-research:reicapivararbx/capyquake","reicapivararbx/capyquake","A Three.js arena shooter with mutant-enemy waves, bosses, progression, an item economy, multiplayer lobbies, and touch controls.","/zh/research/reicapivararbx/capyquake/","repository-research:vkopitsa/browser-shooter","vkopitsa/browser-shooter","A browser FPS combining wave survival, host-authoritative WebRTC multiplayer, a round-based bomb mode, a map editor, and OpenStreetMap-based battlefields.","/zh/research/vkopitsa/browser-shooter/","repository-research:Burry/mark-of-the-veil","Burry/mark-of-the-veil","An eight-chapter browser action campaign with first/third-person switching, arena encounters, bosses, gamepad support, and procedural music.","/zh/research/Burry/mark-of-the-veil/","repository-research:alexdevmotion/grand-theft-austerity-open-world","alexdevmotion/grand-theft-austerity-open-world","A third-person political-satire game with an OpenStreetMap-derived Bucharest, campaign missions, free roam, vehicles, police, weather, and progression.","/zh/research/alexdevmotion/grand-theft-austerity-open-world/","repository-research:Kevin-Liu-01/Claude-of-Tanks","Kevin-Liu-01/Claude-of-Tanks","An armored-combat browser game with plate-level armor, ballistics, destructible battlefields, fixed-step authority, multiplayer, and a scene/vehicle inspection studio.","/zh/research/Kevin-Liu-01/Claude-of-Tanks/","repository-research:corosolto/client","corosolto/client","A Brazilian-satire browser FPS with bot matches, multiplayer beta, procedural and imported assets, and documented visual-evaluation tooling.","/zh/research/corosolto/client/","repository-research:levy-street/world-of-claudecraft","levy-street/world-of-claudecraft","A browser MMO with a shared deterministic game core for an authoritative multiplayer server, an offline world, and a headless Gymnasium environment.","/zh/research/levy-street/world-of-claudecraft/","repository-research:Humpalumps/Cadle","Humpalumps/Cadle","Browser FPS-RPG with data-driven quests, procedural terrain, synthesized audio and separate visual, animation and performance inspection tools.","/zh/research/Humpalumps/Cadle/","foundation:godot-3d-squash","godot-3d-squash","制作可玩的 3D 角色游戏","移动角色、跳踩敌人，并在失败后重试；这个完整的 Godot 项目在小型 3D 场景中教授交互与动画。","/zh/examples/godot-3d-squash/","Make a playable 3D character game","foundation:phaser-starshake","phaser-starshake","把浏览器射击游戏带到移动端","试玩完整太空射击游戏 Starshake，再跟随官方教程适配移动端控制与布局，这条路径基于已有游戏继续开发。","/zh/examples/phaser-starshake/","Take a browser shooter to mobile","foundation:godot-2d-dodge","godot-2d-dodge","第一个 2D 游戏","躲避敌人、尽量生存并重新开始。这个完整的 Godot 官方项目可作为 AI 辅助开发的基础。","/zh/examples/godot-2d-dodge/","Your first 2D game","example:deepseek-mini-ksp","deepseek-mini-ksp","Mini KSP：中文火箭沙盒","在中文航天沙盒中组装多级火箭、发射入轨、解锁科技并完成任务。","/zh/examples/deepseek-mini-ksp/","Mini KSP: a Chinese rocket sandbox","example:deepseek-neon-snake","deepseek-neon-snake","Snake：霓虹街机版","霓虹贪吃蛇，包含关卡、变化的速度和网格尺寸、键盘与触屏输入，以及可保存的最高分。","/zh/examples/deepseek-neon-snake/","Snake: Neon Arcade Edition","example:gemini-pumpkin-hunt","gemini-pumpkin-hunt","Midnight Pumpkin Hunt","第一人称森林恐怖游戏：在追踪者逼近时管理手电电量与体力，点亮五个南瓜。","/zh/examples/gemini-pumpkin-hunt/","example:gemini-kymograph","gemini-kymograph","Kymograph","CRT 风格推理解谜：观察信号、推断隐藏的变换规则，并构造反制信号。","/zh/examples/gemini-kymograph/","example:gemini-pirate-fleet","gemini-pirate-fleet","Pirate Fleet Commander","驾驶旗舰穿越生成海域，与其他船只战斗，用战利品扩建和升级舰队。","/zh/examples/gemini-pirate-fleet/","example:beach-kitty-ai-campaign","beach-kitty-ai-campaign","Beach Kitty","以猫为主角的 Phaser 关卡流程，结合跑酷、平台跳跃、射击和其他街机机制，可选生成猫咪美术。","/zh/examples/beach-kitty-ai-campaign/","example:cursor-destruction-derby","cursor-destruction-derby","Destruction Derby Arena","浏览器汽车战斗竞技场，支持本地双人、电脑对手、碰撞与车辆损伤。","/zh/examples/cursor-destruction-derby/","example:cursor-space-shooter","cursor-space-shooter","Space Shooter：家庭 Cursor 实验","完整俯视角街机射击，包含敌人波次、生命拾取、武器升级和程序化音效。","/zh/examples/cursor-space-shooter/","Space Shooter: a family Cursor experiment","example:agent-arcade-copilot","agent-arcade-copilot","Agent Arcade：Copilot 制作桌面街机游戏","包含平台游戏与太空射击的桌面街机集，通过透明跨平台覆盖窗口运行。","/zh/examples/agent-arcade-copilot/","Agent Arcade: Copilot builds desktop arcade games","example:quasar-saz-claude","quasar-saz-claude","Quasar Saz：Claude Code 创作实验","音乐竞技场射击，包含六个波次、不断演化的乐器武器、程序化画面、合成音频与最终首领。","/zh/examples/quasar-saz-claude/","Quasar Saz: an unusual Claude Code experiment","example:gravity-birds-grok-cursor","gravity-birds-grok-cursor","Gravity Birds：Grok Bot 指挥 Cursor","Godot 网格解谜：成长中的小鸟收集水果、受重力下落并到达出口，包含撤销和原创关卡。","/zh/examples/gravity-birds-grok-cursor/","Gravity Birds: Grok Bot directs Cursor","example:dunkirk-ai-assisted","dunkirk-ai-assisted","Dunkirk：有明确分工记录的辅助开发","二战风格纵向街机射击，提供公开 Godot 项目，以及 AI 和手工贡献的详细分工。","/zh/examples/dunkirk-ai-assisted/","Dunkirk: an honestly documented AI-assisted shooter","example:garden-match-agents","garden-match-agents","Garden Match：代理实现并评审的消除游戏","轻松的三消游戏，包含连锁消除、宠物伙伴、进度保存和随通关成长的花园。","/zh/examples/garden-match-agents/","Garden Match: agents build and review a puzzle game","example:running-man-claude-pixellab","running-man-claude-pixellab","Running Man：Claude Code 与 PixelLab","单键跑酷游戏，结合滚动像素世界、角色动画状态、障碍组合和生成音效。","/zh/examples/running-man-claude-pixellab/","Running Man: Claude Code meets PixelLab","example:bash-fighter-agent","bash-fighter-agent","Bash Fighter：代理开发的多人格斗游戏","浏览器平台格斗游戏，支持在线对战、机器人和坍塌竞技场，客户端与对局服务器均已公开。","/zh/examples/bash-fighter-agent/","Bash Fighter: an agent-developed multiplayer brawler","example:flux-codex-runner","flux-codex-runner","Flux：Codex 重力翻转跑酷","在地板和天花板间切换以躲避障碍的小型反应游戏，包含合成音频和可选主题。","/zh/examples/flux-codex-runner/","Flux: Codex gravity-flip runner","example:claude-mini-snake","claude-mini-snake","Mini Snake：通过 Claude 对话制作的游戏","经典贪吃蛇，包含多种食物效果、粒子反馈、本地最高分和触屏输入。","/zh/examples/claude-mini-snake/","Mini Snake: a Claude conversation game","example:cursor-procedural-platformer","cursor-procedural-platformer","Cursor 程序化平台游戏实验","包含生成关卡、收集品、角色升级和可选多人模式的浏览器横版游戏。","/zh/examples/cursor-procedural-platformer/","Cursor’s procedural platformer experiment","example:claude-tower-defense","claude-tower-defense","Claude Code Tower Defense","在完整塔防游戏中抵挡敌人波次、购买升级，并在多轮游玩间保留永久进度。","/zh/examples/claude-tower-defense/","example:pixel-princess-claude","pixel-princess-claude","Pixel Princess：完整街机关卡流程","在浏览器平台游戏中穿越六个主题世界、击败首领并抵达结局，支持触屏与离线游玩。","/zh/examples/pixel-princess-claude/","Pixel Princess: a complete arcade campaign","example:gothicvania-codex","gothicvania-codex","GothicVania：用 Codex 制作平台游戏","可玩的哥特风平台游戏，包含敌人、战斗、菜单和音乐，并有详细的 Codex 迭代开发记录。","/zh/examples/gothicvania-codex/","GothicVania: Codex builds a platformer","example:fragarena-copilot","fragarena-copilot","FragArena","多人太空竞技场射击，包含六自由度移动、机器人、武器拾取、雷达、计分与重生。","/zh/examples/fragarena-copilot/","example:michi-neko-ai","michi-neko-ai","Michi-Neko · The Cat Philosopher’s Path","京都风格山谷中的早期猫咪探索游戏，包含 NPC 任务、天气、茶屋和进度保存。","/zh/examples/michi-neko-ai/","example:the-tithe-claude","the-tithe-claude","The Tithe","穿越被水淹没的邪教住宅的第一人称恐怖冒险，包含武器、钥匙推进、检查点和最终逃生。","/zh/examples/the-tithe-claude/","example:slide-rush-opus","slide-rush-opus","Slide Rush","面向移动端的滑水道竞速，包含十二名对手、跳跃、捷径、练习模式和程序化角色。","/zh/examples/slide-rush-opus/","example:vibe-jet-gemini","vibe-jet-gemini","Vibe Jet","街机飞行游戏，提供 Gemini 2.5 Pro 提示过程记录和 Node / WebSocket 多人服务器。","/zh/examples/vibe-jet-gemini/","example:dragons-reach-claude","dragons-reach-claude","Dragon’s Reach","程序化龙角色平台游戏，包含浮空岛、滑翔、火焰战斗、可收集龙蛋和最终传送门。","/zh/examples/dragons-reach-claude/","example:ombres-claude","ombres-claude","Ombres","夕阳下，巨鸟用影子为领地着色的 3D 派对游戏，手机也可充当控制器。","/zh/examples/ombres-claude/","example:operation-naptime-claude","operation-naptime-claude","Operation Naptime · Operación Siesta","婴儿逃出围栏，在被抓住前制造客厅混乱；视觉效果与物理采用程序化制作。","/zh/examples/operation-naptime-claude/","example:orb-shooter-ai","orb-shooter-ai","Orb Shooter","小型第一人称射击游戏，将代理编写的机制与随项目提供的仓库、武器和敌人模型组合起来。","/zh/examples/orb-shooter-ai/","example:nova-lancer-claude","nova-lancer-claude","NOVA LANCER","穿越海洋、峡谷和要塞的轨道射击游戏，最终挑战机械海龙首领。","/zh/examples/nova-lancer-claude/","example:long-wind-claude","long-wind-claude","Long Wind","中文武侠动作游戏，包含三章、弹反、首领、生成角色和重定向动画。","/zh/examples/long-wind-claude/","example:turbo-kart-rally-claude","turbo-kart-rally-claude","Turbo Kart Rally","程序化卡丁车竞速，包含漂移、道具战、七名对手，以及有记录的五代理协作开发过程。","/zh/examples/turbo-kart-rally-claude/","example:opengame-mandalorian-shooter","opengame-mandalorian-shooter","Star Wars: Mandalorian Protocol","通过原始战斗简报、可玩版本和完整项目，探索一款生成的俯视角射击游戏。","/zh/examples/opengame-mandalorian-shooter/","example:opengame-arithmancy-card-battle","opengame-arithmancy-card-battle","Harry Potter: Arithmancy Academy","生成式教育卡牌战斗，将数学和科学问题转成施法与连击决策。","/zh/examples/opengame-arithmancy-card-battle/","example:opengame-marvel-platformer","opengame-marvel-platformer","Marvel Avengers: Infinity Strike","研究一款生成式动作平台游戏，包含英雄选择、战斗技能和多阶段开发简报。","/zh/examples/opengame-marvel-platformer/","example:opengame-tower-defense","opengame-tower-defense","Hajimi Defense: The Tuna Crisis","猫咪主题塔防，提供原始生成提示词、在线浏览器版本和对应的完整游戏项目。","/zh/examples/opengame-tower-defense/","example:raccoon-heist-claude","raccoon-heist-claude","Raccoon Heist","Claude 构建的 3D 后院劫案：收集战利品，躲避手电巡逻和看门犬，在黎明前存好收获。","/zh/examples/raccoon-heist-claude/","example:tower-of-time-ai-build","tower-of-time-ai-build","Tower of Time：实现时间回溯机制","包含时间倒流机制的完整塔防游戏，作者提供了覆盖玩法、调试和打磨的大量提示词记录。","/zh/examples/tower-of-time-ai-build/","Tower of Time: prompting a rewind mechanic","example:claude-agent-team-tetris","claude-agent-team-tetris","Tetris：代理团队协作开发","完整的浏览器俄罗斯方块，作者公开说明三个 Claude Code 队友如何分别负责规则、渲染与控制。","/zh/examples/claude-agent-team-tetris/","Tetris built by an AI agent team","example:tron-exonix-claude","tron-exonix-claude","TRON: EXONIX","通过 Claude Code、Godot MCP、Blender MCP 和生成资产制作的霓虹 3D 占地游戏，由人工提供设计与试玩反馈。","/zh/examples/tron-exonix-claude/","example:moonlight-mayhem-codex","moonlight-mayhem-codex","Moonlight & Mayhem","用 Codex 制作的 3D 博物馆劫案：救出两只浣熊队友、躲避安保、叠起小队，偷走金色沙丁鱼。","/zh/examples/moonlight-mayhem-codex/","example:dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli","dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli","Dinosaur Game Offline：Gemini CLI 辅助跑酷","控制像素恐龙跳过仙人掌、躲避飞行障碍，随分数增长体验加速。这个浏览器小游戏包含完整 JavaScript 实现、精灵与音效。","/zh/examples/dinosaur-offline-gemini-cli/","Dinosaur Game Offline: Gemini CLI-assisted runner","example:cloud-crush-gemini-cli","cloud-crush-gemini-cli","Cloud Crush：用 Gemini CLI 制作消除游戏","在 8×8 棋盘上匹配云服务图标，争夺限时高分并创造特殊 Gemini 宝石。Google 公开完整 Go 游戏及 Gemini CLI 开发教程。","/zh/examples/cloud-crush-gemini-cli/","Cloud Crush: Gemini CLI builds a match-3 game","example:roo-code-action","roo-code-action","Action with AI：Roo Code 开发实验","使用 SVG 呈现的俯视角动作原型，包含鼠标瞄准射击、敌人和攻击预警，并附有按提示逐步实现的开发记录。","/zh/examples/roo-code-action/","Action with AI: a Roo Code experiment","example:three-quake-claude-port","three-quake-claude-port","Three Quake：AI 辅助移植 Quake","在 Three.js 浏览器移植版中试玩 Quake 共享版篇章，研究如何借助 AI 改造已有射击游戏的渲染与运行时。","/zh/examples/three-quake-claude-port/","Three Quake: an AI-assisted Quake port","example:crown-defender-codex","crown-defender-codex","Crown Defender TD 3D · Codex build","在等距视角下操控英雄，抵挡三十波敌人保护城堡，通过升级组合赢得装饰皇冠。","/zh/examples/crown-defender-codex/","example:arkanoid-neon-claude","arkanoid-neon-claude","Arkanoid Neon","让球反弹穿过八种霓虹砖块布局，收集强化道具，并应对逐渐加快的节奏。这款完整浏览器游戏使用 Canvas 2D 与实时合成的 Web Audio。","/zh/examples/arkanoid-neon-claude/","example:supermarket-simulator-cursor","supermarket-simulator-cursor","Supermarket Simulator","以第一人称经营超市：订货、拆包、补货，并在收银台服务顾客。作者使用 Cursor 完成这个 Unity 实验，并使用 Hunyuan 生成 3D 模型。","/zh/examples/supermarket-simulator-cursor/","example:magic-carpet-wizard-astra","magic-carpet-wizard-astra","Magic Carpet Wizard · A Thousand Skies","驾驶飞毯掠过微型球形世界，穿越计分圆环、使用三种法术并迎战敌人与首领。本地幽灵竞速支持两人轮流挑战。","/zh/examples/magic-carpet-wizard-astra/","example:sakura-crossing-qwen","sakura-crossing-qwen","3D Sakura Crossing：本地 Qwen 探索原型","探索卡通渲染的日本街区，体验运行中的铁路道口、居民对话、开合桥、可驾驶小车与可游泳河流。","/zh/examples/sakura-crossing-qwen/","3D Sakura Crossing: an exploration prototype","example:claude-dreaming-godot","claude-dreaming-godot","Claude Dreaming","从像素风阁楼走入可玩的 3D 画作，探索梦境花园、太空飞行、小行星与社区共同制作的房间。","/zh/examples/claude-dreaming-godot/","example:sprout-quest-claude","sprout-quest-claude","Sprout Quest","探索小世界，参加实时竞技场战斗，采集材料、锻造装备并重建村庄。Sprout Quest 面向竖屏手机，将二维世界与实时渲染的三维角色、道具组合在一起。","/zh/examples/sprout-quest-claude/","example:mosswing-astra","mosswing-astra","Mosswing","通过单键振翅让小生物保持飞行，穿过不断滚动的石柱缺口，在精简的 3D 网页游戏中挑战更高分。","/zh/examples/mosswing-astra/","example:astra-floor-ai","astra-floor-ai","Astra Floor","在第一人称工业场地中抵挡六波僵尸并挑战最终首领，管理弹药、后坐力、体力和每轮间的商店采购。","/zh/examples/astra-floor-ai/","example:isocoaster-cursor","isocoaster-cursor","IsoCoaster","铺设过山车轨道、安排游乐设施，经营有游客活动的主题公园。IsoCoaster 与 IsoCity 共用仓库，但拥有独立的可玩游戏和页面入口。","/zh/examples/isocoaster-cursor/","example:spirit-of-kiro","spirit-of-kiro","Spirit of Kiro","寻找奇特物品，在工坊中组合、拆解或改变它们，再交给 AI 估价师出售，体验开放式合成玩法。","/zh/examples/spirit-of-kiro/","example:rhythm-master-windsurf","rhythm-master-windsurf","Rhythm Master 3D","四轨音乐节奏游戏，包含合成器曲目、难度选择、连击和特殊模式，完整实现集中在一个浏览器 HTML 文件中。","/zh/examples/rhythm-master-windsurf/","example:pokemon-tactics-claude","pokemon-tactics-claude","Pokemon Tactics","让宝可梦在等距战场上移动，利用高低差，并在范围攻击时避开队友。这款可玩的同人战棋采用 TypeScript 模拟核心、2D-HD 精灵和 Babylon.js 地形。","/zh/examples/pokemon-tactics-claude/","example:clowder-and-crest-agents","clowder-and-crest-agents","Clowder & Crest","招募猫咪组成中世纪公会，在十五类小游戏中接取任务、培养羁绊，并体验受公会声望影响的七章剧情。","/zh/examples/clowder-and-crest-agents/","example:novel-journey-to-west","novel-journey-to-west","西游记：三借芭蕉扇","把三借芭蕉扇篇章改编为中文回合制 RPG，包含彩绘场景行走、任务、装备、宠物和指令战斗。","/zh/examples/novel-journey-to-west/","Journey to the West: Three Borrowings of the Banana Fan","example:vibe-racer-opencode","vibe-racer-opencode","Vibe Racer","俯视角计时赛车，包含本地最佳成绩、玩家与作者的幽灵车、泥地路面，以及内置赛道编辑器。","/zh/examples/vibe-racer-opencode/","example:golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","golden-hour-skatepark-cursor","Golden Hour Skatepark","在原创海边滑板场中压弯、起跳、翻板、滑杆、平衡，摔倒后重新上板。这是完整的第三人称滑板沙盒，显示短暂的技巧连段，支持切换日照，没有关卡或持久积分。","/zh/examples/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor/","example:castle-clash-duel-claude","castle-clash-duel-claude","Castle Clash Duel","招募战士与弓箭手，在瓦片地图上进行双人战术对抗。这个完整 Phaser 原型由 Claude Code 实现，并使用 Pixel Frog 制作的 Tiny Swords 美术素材。","/zh/examples/castle-clash-duel-claude/","example:silent-meridian-codex","silent-meridian-codex","Silent Meridian · 静默子午线","调查停在 00:17 的观测站，在“现在”与“回声”之间切换，借助日志与可选提示，解开四章中的十三道关联谜题。","/zh/examples/silent-meridian-codex/","Silent Meridian","example:morbreaker-unity-claude","morbreaker-unity-claude","morBreaker","用挡板引导不断加速的小球，挑战十个难度递增的打砖块关卡，包含多段耐久砖块与本地高分记录。","/zh/examples/morbreaker-unity-claude/","example:deep-yellow-claude","deep-yellow-claude","DEEP YELLOW","在程序生成的后室中探索。这是一款第一人称回合制 Roguelike：移动或等待会触发战斗，装备组合与理智值共同影响每次冒险。","/zh/examples/deep-yellow-claude/","example:surge-for-oinja-codex","surge-for-oinja-codex","SURGE for Oinja","在两张可互动地图中对抗机械怪潮，组合电气能力形成构筑。攻击自动发动，玩家负责移动、闪避、选择升级和恢复设施。","/zh/examples/surge-for-oinja-codex/","example:project-plateau","project-plateau","Project Plateau: Proof Before Dark","受《失落的世界》启发的第一人称野外摄影探险：为史前动物取景，分配四张感光板，避开威胁，并在天色变暗前返回营地。","/zh/examples/project-plateau/","example:isocity-cursor","isocity-cursor","IsoCity","用分区、道路、铁路和公共设施建造一座等距城市，观察人口与交通模拟。IsoCity 是完整的 Canvas 浏览器游戏，作者明确表示使用 Cursor 开发。","/zh/examples/isocity-cursor/","example:butch-graves-j2me","butch-graves-j2me","Butch Graves 3D","在五个万圣节射击篇章中挑战首领、寻找钥匙与秘密，观看游戏内过场。作品使用为 Java 功能手机制作的小型光线投射引擎。","/zh/examples/butch-graves-j2me/","example:pixel-orchard-astra","pixel-orchard-astra","像素果园 · 记忆收获","翻开十二张种子卡，找出六组相同符号。记录步数、记住翻错的卡牌，然后重新洗牌进行下一轮。","/zh/examples/pixel-orchard-astra/","Pixel Orchard · Memory Harvest","example:fruit-ninja-dojo-astra","fruit-ninja-dojo-astra","水果忍者 · 再来一刀","挥刀切开腾空的水果，积累连击并避开炸弹。这款非官方复刻提供经典、六十秒街机和九十秒禅模式。","/zh/examples/fruit-ninja-dojo-astra/","Fruit Ninja Dojo · One More Slice","example:thunderfall-astra","thunderfall-astra","雷霆战机 · 天穹远征","从三种战机中选择一架，穿越五大空域，在漂移弹、激光和首领攻击间寻找航路。拾取四色武器，并在关间选择强化。","/zh/examples/thunderfall-astra/","THUNDERFALL · Skyward Expedition","example:nagi-home-cowork","nagi-home-cowork","Nagi Home：小螃蟹的日常","照顾住在程序化小屋里的螃蟹 Nagi：放食物、扔球、邀请它使用家具，并从日记观察每日需求变化。这个安静的生活模拟器会保存进度。","/zh/examples/nagi-home-cowork/","Nagi Home","example:clockout-unseen-codex","clockout-unseen-codex","准点下班，别被发现","在三层办公室中限时潜行，利用家具遮挡、咖啡机干扰和临时文件夹伪装避开巡逻视线，抵达电梯下班。","/zh/examples/clockout-unseen-codex/","Clock Out Unseen","example:fishslop-claude","fishslop-claude","Fishslop","驾驶潜水器进入沉没的珊瑚礁，喂鱼、收集掉落的硬币，购买新鱼种和潜艇部件。声呐能短暂揭示平时隐形的 Veilfin。","/zh/examples/fishslop-claude/","example:pelican-bike-claude","pelican-bike-claude","Pelican on a Bike：鹈鹕骑单车","让戴着头盔的鹈鹕沿程序化海岸骑行，变道抓鱼、跳跃并解锁小成就。完整 Three.js 工程包含角色、单车、海洋、音频与昼夜系统。","/zh/examples/pelican-bike-claude/","Pelican on a Bike","example:three-kingdoms-codex","three-kingdoms-codex","三分天下 · 百将风云","经营钱粮、发展城池，在十五座据点间统率武将作战。选择魏、蜀或吴，与两个电脑势力竞争，一统地图。","/zh/examples/three-kingdoms-codex/","Three Kingdoms: Hundred Heroes","example:fang-fox-gbc-claude","fang-fox-gbc-claude","Fang the Fox · Game Boy Color","以真正的 Game Boy Color 游戏形式探索浮空岛、挑战首领、解开谜题，体验小狐狸的冒险。可在浏览器模拟器中试玩，也可下载 ROM 在掌机或模拟器中运行。","/zh/examples/fang-fox-gbc-claude/","example:vibe-golf-bevy","vibe-golf-bevy","Vibe Golf","在布满山坡与装饰物的 3D 地形上蓄力击球，追逐移动的鸭子目标，体验小型街机高尔夫沙盒。","/zh/examples/vibe-golf-bevy/","example:core-business-claude","core-business-claude","Core Business","向下钻掘矿物，管理燃料与机体状态，回到地面商店出售矿产和升级。这是受 Motherload 启发的非商业采矿技术演示：Three.js 渲染 2.5D 世界，Blender 脚本制作三维资产。","/zh/examples/core-business-claude/","example:eight-second-crew-codex","eight-second-crew-codex","8 秒盗贼团","录制一段八秒行动，让分身在下一轮重播，与过去的自己合作偷取钥匙并逃脱。九个关卡逐步加入机关踏板、巡逻者和投射物。","/zh/examples/eight-second-crew-codex/","8-Second Crew · 8초 도둑단","example:word-rain-chatgpt","word-rain-chatgpt","Word Rain","移动篮子，按顺序接住字母拼成单词，同时躲避红色危险方块。护盾、万能字母、完美单词连击和变化的下落速度，让拼字街机不断增加挑战。","/zh/examples/word-rain-chatgpt/","example:minimal-rogue-claude","minimal-rogue-claude","Minimal Rogue","探索黑白地牢、打碎方块，管理体力和装备，逐层深入 ASCII 风格的肉鸽冒险。游戏提供英文和日文界面。","/zh/examples/minimal-rogue-claude/","example:polar-icecapade-claude","polar-icecapade-claude","Polar Icecapade","在冰面 3D 场景中滑行，用三段近战连击向前推进，射击时利用后坐力向后移动。穿过闸门、收集金币，在短篇 Game Jam 冒险中对抗老鼠政权。","/zh/examples/polar-icecapade-claude/","example:overexposed-ai","overexposed-ai","Overexposed","通过卡牌选择，引导一位初露头角的艺人度过一年的职业生涯。平衡技艺、金钱和关注度，观察三家报纸的反应，避免过高热度引发丑闻。","/zh/examples/overexposed-ai/","example:katana-kitsune-godot","katana-kitsune-godot","Katana Kitsune: Prototype","选择狐妖剑士，在等距视角的动作肉鸽中迎战妖怪、管理体力、拾取道具并深入地牢。这个无声原型支持本地多人，当前源码还记录了后续队伍系统。","/zh/examples/katana-kitsune-godot/","paper:paper-doi-10-1080-14786445008521796","paper-doi-10-1080-14786445008521796","Programming a computer for playing chess","Journal paper cited as reference [281] in AI for Games in the Foundation Model Era. The London, Edinburgh, and Dublin Philosophical Magazine and Journal of Science, 41(314):256–275, 1950.","https://doi.org/10.1080/14786445008521796","paper:paper-doi-10-1147-rd-33-0210","paper-doi-10-1147-rd-33-0210","Some studies in machine learning using the game of checkers","Journal paper cited as reference [272] in AI for Games in the Foundation Model Era. IBM Journal of Research and Development, 3(3):210–229, 1959.","https://doi.org/10.1147/rd.33.0210","paper:paper-doi-10-1016-b978-1-55860-141-3-50030-4","paper-doi-10-1016-b978-1-55860-141-3-50030-4","Integrated architectures for learning, planning, and reacting based on approximating dynamic programming","Conference paper cited as reference [309] in AI for Games in the Foundation Model Era. In International Confer