xiv.org/abs/2404.02039","resource:marble","marble","World Labs Marble","生成可持续导航的 3D 场景，支持 splat 与网格导出。","/zh/resources/marble/","resource:wonderworld","wonderworld","WonderWorld","从单张图像构建可探索、可继续扩展的显式 3D 场景。","/zh/resources/wonderworld/","resource:oasis","oasis","Oasis: A Universe in a Transformer","根据历史帧和动作预测类 Minecraft 画面的神经游戏研究。","/zh/resources/oasis/","resource:gamefactory","gamefactory","GameFactory","结合开放领域视频生成与键盘、鼠标动作控制的交互视频研究。","/zh/resources/gamefactory/","resource:diamond","diamond","DIAMOND — Diffusion for World Modeling","让强化学习代理在保留视觉细节的扩散世界模型中训练。","/zh/resources/diamond/","resource:gamengen","gamengen","GameNGen — Diffusion Models Are Real-Time Game Engines","从 DOOM 游玩轨迹训练可交互的扩散模拟器。","/zh/resources/gamengen/","resource:genie-3","genie-3","Genie 3 / Project Genie","根据提示词生成可实时探索的交互视频世界。","/zh/resources/genie-3/","resource:genie","genie","从没有动作标签的视频中，学习由潜在动作控制的 2D 世界。","/zh/resources/genie/","resource:factorsim","factorsim","FactorSim","通过因子化状态表示，从语言生成模拟环境与任务代码。","/zh/resources/factorsim/","resource:poe-world","poe-world","PoE-World","组合小型程序专家，建模具有随机性的世界动态。","/zh/resources/poe-world/","resource:cwm-general-game-playing","cwm-general-game-playing","将自然语言游戏规则编译成可验证模拟器，用于 MCTS 规划。","/zh/resources/cwm-general-game-playing/","resource:gif-mcts-cwm","gif-mcts-cwm","GIF-MCTS / Code World Models Benchmark","通过生成、改进与修复的树搜索，合成可运行环境模型。","/zh/resources/gif-mcts-cwm/","resource:worldcoder","worldcoder","WorldCoder","从环境交互归纳 Python 世界模型，再在模型内进行规划。","/zh/resources/worldcoder/","resource:solarwm","solarwm","SolarWM","面向开放数据、训练和长时推理的交互视频世界模型框架。","/zh/resources/solarwm/","resource:magpie-renderer","magpie-renderer","游戏引擎运行玩法，独立 Render Server 生成最终视觉画面。","/zh/resources/magpie-renderer/","resource:coder-world-model","coder-world-model","CoDeR — Code Plans, Diffusion Renders","多代理共同构建可执行世界，再由扩散模型渲染观察结果。","/zh/resources/coder-world-model/","resource:programmable-world-model","programmable-world-model","用显式全局状态与可编程规则，保持视野外实体的持续性。","/zh/resources/programmable-world-model/","resource:code-world-model-brain","code-world-model-brain","让编程代理编写可执行规则与持久状态，驱动视频世界演化。","/zh/resources/code-world-model-brain/","resource:streamrender-h3","streamrender-h3","StreamRender-H3","由代码引擎维护世界状态，通过流式扩散渲染语义地图。","/zh/resources/streamrender-h3/","resource:solarrenderer","solarrenderer","SolarRenderer","把引擎或代理生成的结构视频，转成带风格的最终画面。","/zh/resources/solarrenderer/","resource:level-design-book-skill","/zh/resources/level-design-book-skill/","resource:playwright-test","playwright-test","Playwright Test","提供 DOM 操作、断言和截图比较的浏览器测试框架。","/zh/resources/playwright-test/","resource:directx-shader-compiler","directx-shader-compiler","DirectX Shader Compiler","通过 dxc 命令行或编译器 API 编译 HLSL 的工具。","/zh/resources/directx-shader-compiler/","resource:fastnoise-lite","fastnoise-lite","FastNoise Lite","跨语言的便携噪声库，为程序化地形和材质提供基础输入。","/zh/resources/fastnoise-lite/","resource:msdf-atlas-gen","msdf-atlas-gen","MSDF Atlas Generator","从字体生成距离场图集的命令行与库工具。","/zh/resources/msdf-atlas-gen/","resource:xbox-accessibility-guidelines","xbox-accessibility-guidelines","Xbox Accessibility Guidelines","面向设计师、开发者和测试团队的游戏无障碍指南。","/zh/resources/xbox-accessibility-guidelines/","resource:elevenlabs-speech","elevenlabs-speech","ElevenLabs Speech Generation","按指定音色合成语音，支持发音词典和相邻请求上下文衔接。","/zh/resources/elevenlabs-speech/","resource:elevenlabs-music","elevenlabs-music","ElevenLabs Music","支持编曲计划、参考音频和分段编辑的提示式音乐生成。","/zh/resources/elevenlabs-music/","resource:windows-ui-automation","windows-ui-automation","Windows · UI Automation and Input Semantics","通过控件提供的无障碍模式，检查和操作 Windows 桌面编辑器。","/zh/resources/windows-ui-automation/","resource:unreal-gauntlet","unreal-gauntlet","Unreal Engine · Gauntlet","编排包含多进程、角色、设备和日志采集的 Unreal 游戏测试会话。","/zh/resources/unreal-gauntlet/","resource:crazygames","crazygames","CrazyGames","试玩浏览器游戏，并准备 CrazyGames 的网页构建提交、测试与上线。","/zh/resources/crazygames/","resource:gog","gog","GOG","发现无 DRM 的桌面游戏，并向 GOG 的精选目录提交自己的作品。","/zh/resources/gog/","resource:epic-games-store","epic-games-store","Epic Games Store","浏览已发行游戏，通过 Epic 的自助开发者工具准备商店发行。","/zh/resources/epic-games-store/","resource:itch-io","itch-io","itch.io","发现独立游戏，并在项目页面发布浏览器版本或可下载的游戏。","/zh/resources/itch-io/","resource:steamworks","steamworks","Steam","浏览桌面游戏，并通过 Steamworks 准备商店页面、构建、测试与发布。","/zh/resources/steamworks/","resource:convai","convai","Convai","通过语音、记忆、情绪和场景内动作，为游戏加入对话 NPC。","/zh/resources/convai/","resource:modl-ai","modl-ai","modl.ai","通过视觉代理和自然语言任务，测试上传游戏构建的商业服务。","/zh/resources/modl-ai/","resource:regression-games","regression-games","Regression Games","提供公开 Unity SDK，用于玩法记录、输入回放和回归测试参考流程。","/zh/resources/regression-games/","resource:stable-audio-open","stable-audio-open","Stable Audio Open 1.0","提供可下载的文生音频权重与本地工具，面向音效和现场录音。","/zh/resources/stable-audio-open/","resource:elevenlabs-sfx","elevenlabs-sfx","ElevenLabs Sound Effects","通过网页或 API，从文本生成游戏音效、拟音与循环环境声。","/zh/resources/elevenlabs-sfx/","resource:hy-motion","hy-motion","HY-Motion 1.0","从文本生成人形骨骼动作，公开推理代码与模型权重。","/zh/resources/hy-motion/","resource:meshy","meshy","Meshy API","将 AI 模型生成、人形绑定和动画导出接入游戏资产流程的 API。","/zh/resources/meshy/","resource:scenario","scenario","Scenario","用定制风格模型与批量生成，构建一致的游戏美术流程。","/zh/resources/scenario/","resource:tripo-generation-api","tripo-generation-api","Tripo Model Generation API","按版本提供文生模型能力，分别控制几何和纹理随机种子。","/zh/resources/tripo-generation-api/","resource:unigen","unigen","UniGen","规划 Unity 原型、生成脚本、组装场景，并支持迭代调试的多代理流程。","/zh/resources/unigen/","resource:autoue","autoue","AutoUE","协调代理构建 Unreal 场景、玩法代码、交互与试玩的研究流程。","/zh/resources/autoue/","resource:blenderllm","blenderllm","BlenderLLM / BlendNet / CADBench","研究文本到 Blender 脚本的系统，配有训练数据与建模基准。","/zh/resources/blenderllm/","resource:video2game","video2game","Video2Game","把真实世界视频重建成可在浏览器交互的 3D 环境。","/zh/resources/video2game/","resource:holodeck","holodeck","Holodeck","根据文本布置带家具、可交互的 3D 室内环境。","/zh/resources/holodeck/","resource:infinigen","infinigen","Infinigen","程序化生成自然与室内 Blender 场景，以及配套合成数据。","/zh/resources/infinigen/","resource:triposr","triposr","TripoSR","从单张图像快速重建 3D 物体，适合资产原型制作。","/zh/resources/triposr/","resource:trellis","trellis","TRELLIS","通过结构化潜在表示，生成网格、高斯和辐射场等 3D 输出。","/zh/resources/trellis/","resource:hunyuan3d-2","hunyuan3d-2","Hunyuan3D 2.0","从参考图生成几何与纹理，为 3D 资产流程提供输入。","/zh/resources/hunyuan3d-2/","resource:godot-3d-asset-skill","godot-3d-asset-skill","Godot MCP 3D Asset Builder","用 Godot 几何与验证流程构建可复用的风格化 3D 资产。","/zh/resources/godot-3d-asset-skill/","resource:mcp-unity","mcp-unity","MCP Unity Editor","用于查询、编辑和测试 Unity 项目的社区 MCP 桥接。","/zh/resources/mcp-unity/","resource:unity-agent-plugin","unity-agent-plugin","Unity Agent Plugin","Unity 维护的项目技能包，为通用编程代理提供引擎专用上下文。","/zh/resources/unity-agent-plugin/","resource:gameenginebench","gameenginebench","GameEngineBench","在真实 Unreal Engine 项目中测试代理编写的 C++ 运行时代码。","/zh/resources/gameenginebench/","resource:gamefactory-3a","gamefactory-3a","3AGameFactory","通过技能包、模型流程和引擎适配器，协调游戏资产、玩法与 UI 制作。","/zh/resources/gamefactory-3a/","resource:openai-image-api","openai-image-api","OpenAI Image Generation","使用图像端点或对话式图像工具，生成与编辑栅格美术。","/zh/resources/openai-image-api/","resource:agent-sprite-forge","agent-sprite-forge","Agent Sprite Forge","将参考图、生成动画和确定性处理组合成可导出的精灵资产。","/zh/resources/agent-sprite-forge/","resource:pixellab","pixellab","PixelLab AI Agent Toolkit","通过 API 和 MCP 生成像素角色、动画及无缝瓦片集的资产工具。","/zh/resources/pixellab/","resource:text2game","text2game","Text2Game","把长文本转成世界、角色和事件数据，用于叙事游戏原型。","/zh/resources/text2game/","resource:agent-game-forge","agent-game-forge","Agent Game Forge","面向 Codex 与 Claude Code 的本地 2D 游戏 IDE，包含可视化场景编辑器。","/zh/resources/agent-game-forge/","resource:cardiverse","cardiverse","Cardiverse","把卡牌游戏设计、Python 规则代码和试玩连接起来的原型流程。","/zh/resources/cardiverse/","resource:gavel","gavel","GAVEL","结合语言模型与质量多样性搜索，生成棋盘游戏规则。","/zh/resources/gavel/","resource:mariogpt","mariogpt","MarioGPT","用 GPT 根据文本描述生成马里奥风格的可玩关卡布局。","/zh/resources/mariogpt/","resource:gamegen-verifier","gamegen-verifier","GameGen-Verifier","通过运行时状态钩子与针对性检查，验证生成游戏的行为。","/zh/resources/gamegen-verifier/","