examples/","resource:threejs","threejs","Three.js","面向浏览器的 JavaScript 3D 渲染库，提供场景、相机、材质和资源加载器。","/zh/resources/threejs/","resource:epic-developer-community","epic-developer-community","Epic Developer Community · UE","Epic 的 UE 社区入口，汇集作者教程、学习资料和版本相关讨论。","/zh/resources/epic-developer-community/","resource:unreal-lyra","Lyra Sample Game","Epic 的模块化 UE5 示例游戏，包含玩法插件、能力、动画、输入和 UI。","/zh/resources/unreal-lyra/","resource:unreal-automation-tests","unreal-automation-tests","Unreal · Automation Test Framework","UE 官方测试基础设施，支持单元、功能、内容压力和截图比较测试。","/zh/resources/unreal-automation-tests/","resource:unreal-engine","unreal-engine","Unreal Engine · Documentation","Epic 官方 UE 文档，覆盖 C++、Blueprint、渲染、动画、物理与打包。","/zh/resources/unreal-engine/","resource:catlike-coding-movement","catlike-coding-movement","Catlike Coding · Surface Contact","Jasper Flick 的 Unity 移动教程，分析斜坡、台阶、接触时序和角色控制。","/zh/resources/catlike-coding-movement/","resource:unity-2d-techdemos","unity-2d-techdemos","Unity · 2D Tech Demos","Unity 官方 2D 示例源码，展示 Tilemap、Scripted Tile、笔刷和运行时地图修改。","/zh/resources/unity-2d-techdemos/","resource:unity-test-framework","unity-test-framework","Unity Test Framework","Unity 官方测试框架，支持 Edit mode、Play mode 和命令行执行。","/zh/resources/unity-test-framework/","resource:unity-engine","unity-engine","Unity · Manual","Unity 官方手册，覆盖项目、编辑器、脚本、渲染、物理、资产导入与发布。","/zh/resources/unity-engine/","resource:gdquest-first-2d-game","gdquest-first-2d-game","GDQuest · First 2D Game","GDQuest 的 Godot 2D 生存游戏教程，包含完整脚本、项目和故障排查说明。","/zh/resources/gdquest-first-2d-game/","resource:godot-gut","godot-gut","GUT · Godot Unit Test","为 GDScript 提供断言、测试替身和参数化用例的社区 Godot 测试框架。","/zh/resources/godot-gut/","resource:godot-demo-projects","godot-demo-projects","Godot Demo Projects","覆盖 2D、3D、GUI、音频、网络和渲染的 Godot 官方可运行示例。","/zh/resources/godot-demo-projects/","resource:godot-command-line","godot-command-line","Godot · Command Line Tutorial","Godot 官方命令行参考，涵盖无头运行、脚本检查、资产导入、执行和导出。","/zh/resources/godot-command-line/","resource:godot-engine","godot-engine","Godot Engine · Official Documentation","通过场景、节点、资源和脚本组织项目的开源 2D / 3D 游戏引擎。","/zh/resources/godot-engine/","resource:playwright-mcp","playwright-mcp","Playwright MCP","Microsoft 的浏览器自动化 MCP 服务，向代理提供页面结构、交互与浏览器反馈。","/zh/resources/playwright-mcp/","resource:unreal-mcp","unreal-mcp","Unreal MCP · chongdashu","用 Python MCP 服务和 UE C++ 插件连接代理与 Actor、Blueprint、视口控制的社区项目。","/zh/resources/unreal-mcp/","resource:mcp-for-blender","mcp-for-blender","MCP for Blender","让代理进行建模、材质设置、Python 执行和视觉反馈的 Blender 插件与 MCP 服务。","/zh/resources/mcp-for-blender/","resource:godot-mcp","godot-mcp","Godot MCP · Coding-Solo","支持启动 Godot、运行项目、读取日志及基础场景操作的社区 MCP 服务。","/zh/resources/godot-mcp/","resource:unity-mcp-skill","unity-mcp-skill","Unity-MCP Operator Guide","MCP for Unity 的操作指南：先检查编辑器状态，再执行、等待编译与域重载，最后核验结果。","/zh/resources/unity-mcp-skill/","resource:unity-mcp","unity-mcp","MCP for Unity","将通用编程代理连接到 Unity Editor 的社区 MCP 桥接。","/zh/resources/unity-mcp/","resource:codex-browser-games","codex-browser-games","Codex · Create Browser-based Games","OpenAI 的浏览器游戏开发流程，涵盖规划、项目指令、资产生成和浏览器迭代。","/zh/resources/codex-browser-games/","resource:agent-skills-format","agent-skills-format","Agent Skills","把领域流程打包成 SKILL.md 指令、脚本和参考资料的开放格式。","/zh/resources/agent-skills-format/","resource:agents-md","agents-md","AGENTS.md","用 Markdown 向编程代理说明构建命令、测试规则和项目约定的开放格式。","/zh/resources/agents-md/","resource:mini-swe-agent","mini-swe-agent","便于修改和检查执行轨迹的最小 Shell 编程代理研究基线。","/zh/resources/mini-swe-agent/","resource:claude-agent-sdk","claude-agent-sdk","Claude Agent SDK","在 Python 或 TypeScript 应用中嵌入 Claude Code 的工具循环、权限、会话与扩展。","/zh/resources/claude-agent-sdk/","resource:openhands-sdk","openhands-sdk","OpenHands Software Agent SDK","为代理、工具、对话、工作区和服务端接口提供可编程开发框架。","/zh/resources/openhands-sdk/","resource:openhands","openhands","OpenHands · Agent Canvas","管理本地、远程和云端代理环境的开源开发控制台。","/zh/resources/openhands/","resource:aider","aider","Aider","围绕仓库地图、Git 改动、静态检查和测试反馈组织工作的终端 AI 配对编程工具。","/zh/resources/aider/","res